摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"GLM-5.3-Flash × J-Space capability realization — benchmark presentation of the J-Space Cognition Suite","id":"gh:1335867536","install_available":false,"language":null,"name":"GLM-5.3-Flash-J-Space-Capability-Realization-Report","slug":"Tiger3807861189/GLM-5.3-Flash-J-Space-Capability-Realization-Report","topics":["agent-skills","ai-agent","benchmark","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"GLM-5.3-Flash × J-Space capability realization — benchmark presentation of the J-Space Cognition Sui"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"M-5.3-Flash × J-Space capability realization — benchmark presentation of the J-Space Cognition Suite"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# J-Space Cognition Suite V3.7"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"J-Space Cognition Suite is a model-agnostic inference-time control system for deep reasoning, long-h"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"orizon work, tool use, verification, and recovery."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"It is packaged as a Skill for cross-platform use, selective loading, and low-friction integration."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The suite organizes an agent's accessible working representations into a deliberately managed worksp"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ace. It operates through a single entry, nine selectively loaded modules, four supporting references"},{"id":"p6s3","text":", and an optional standard-library controller for durable task state."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"J-Space operates at inference time. Model weights and training remain unchanged."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### Option A — manual installation"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"1. Download or clone this repository.\n2. Locate the user-level Skills directory used by your AI host"},{"id":"p10s2","text":".\n3. Copy the complete `j-space/` directory into it so that the installed entry is `<skills-director"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"y>/j-space/SKILL.md`.\n4. Run the integrity check with an available Python 3 interpreter:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Replace `<python-command>` with the Python 3 command available on the host, commonly `python`, `pyth"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"command>` with the Python 3 command available on the host, commonly `python`, `python3`, or `py -3`."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"5. Reload the host if it discovers Skills at startup."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- The directory must remain intact because `SKILL.md` routes to relative paths under `modules/`, `re"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"ferences/`, and `scripts/`."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- The repository-level `LICENSE` and `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` remain part of the distribution.\n- Inc"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"lude copies of both when redistributing `j-space/` as a standalone package."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Option B — ask an AI agent to install it"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Copy the following prompt into an agent that can access files and this repository:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### Use it"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Invoke the Skill through the mechanism provided by your host—such as its Skill picker,\n`/j-space`, `"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"$j-space`, or a direct request:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The entry gate selects the lightest suitable pass automatically."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Operating modes"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Pass | Suitable work | What loads |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| `fast` | One step, or a result checkable in one glance | Nothing extra |\n| `full` | Several depend"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ent steps and one bounded deliverable | One or two relevant modules; `ship` before delivery |\n| `loo"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"p` | Multiple stages, files, turns, tools, or persistent state | Ledger, seams, checkpoints, registe"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"r audit, and recovery |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"A request for brevity changes the outer response length while verification remains aligned with the "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"task's floor. Short work stays light; long work receives durable state only when it needs it."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## Core mechanisms"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"| Mechanism | Function |"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| Selective workspace loading | Keeps one or two load-bearing ideas active and externalizes the rest"},{"id":"p29s2","text":" |\n| Broadcast hub | Gives dependent branches one shared source for names, values, constraints, and "},{"id":"p29s3","text":"style anchors |\n| Dense Track | Carries long internal chains in compact, decodable notation before r"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"eturning to clean outer language |\n| Bridge-before-conclusion reasoning | Makes required intermediat"},{"id":"p29s5","text":"es explicit before a conclusion consumes them |\n| Metacognitive control | Routes confidence, inconsi"},{"id":"p29s6","text":"stency, and failure signals into a concrete next action |\n| Empirical escape and verification | Conv"},{"id":"p29s7","text":"erts stalled derivation into bounded tests with a named verifier and coverage |\n| First-person agenc"},{"id":"p29s8","text":"y and functional echo | Uses `I`, `we`, `let's`, and `we need` to bind workspace state to later acti"},{"id":"p29s9","text":" echo | Uses `I`, `we`, `let's`, and `we need` to bind workspace state to later actions and checks |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The mechanisms are selectively loaded. They are not a fixed checklist for every request."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Optional controller"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"`j-space/scripts/jspace.py` externalizes `loop` state into\n`.jspace/` in the current task workspace."},{"id":"p32s2","text":" Invoke it by its resolved Skill path while keeping the task workspace as the current directory."},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| Command | Purpose |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"| `note --goal \"...\" --next \"...\"` | Open the ledger and define done plus the first action |\n| `note"},{"id":"p34s2","text":" --next \"...\"` | Replace the single next action after a checkpoint or seam |\n| `note --core \"name — "},{"id":"p34s3","text":"defining fact\"` | Record a hub entry |\n| `note --core \"name — defining fact\" --core-slot 1` | Swap a"},{"id":"p34s4","text":" selected live hub entry |\n| `note --check \"...\" --by \"...\"` | Append a checkpoint with verifier and"},{"id":"p34s5","text":" coverage |\n| `note --open \"...\" --settled-by \"...\"` | Record a question and what would settle it |\n"},{"id":"p34s6","text":"| `note --close N --check \"...\" --by \"...\"` | Close question `N` against a new recorded checkpoint |"},{"id":"p34s7","text":"\n| `seam` | Re-read current state and report recent movement |\n| `ship FILE` | Inspect outgoing text"},{"id":"p34s8","text":" for register leakage and failure signatures |\n| `resume` | Reload the premise, invariants, and full"},{"id":"p34s9","text":" ledger after a long gap |"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"The controller records and reports state. Solution choice remains with the model. It uses the Python"},{"id":"p36s2","text":" standard library and writes working state only under the task's `.jspace/` directory."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Generic model integration"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"An environment with a native Skill loader can install `j-space/` directly. For a chat or API environ"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"ment, provide `j-space/SKILL.md` as a system- or developer-level instruction and expose `modules/` a"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"nd `references/` through file or retrieval tools."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"Selected files should be retrieved on demand. Selective loading is part of the operating design."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"## Benchmark"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"### 1. Main table"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"| Benchmark                | GLM-5.3-Flash | GLM-5.3-Flash **+ J-Space V3.7**† | GLM-5.3 | Opus-5 | "},{"id":"p42s2","text":"Fable 5.1 |\n| ------------------------ | ------------: | -------------------------------: | ------: "},{"id":"p42s3","text":"| -----: | --------: |\n| HLE (w/ tools)           |          55.3 |                              59."},{"id":"p42s4","text":"2 |    62.5 |   64.7 |      65.0 |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## Cross-model compatibility"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"The operating effects have been reproduced across the DeepSeek, Qwen, GLM, GPT, and Claude model fam"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"ilies. Effect size varies with base capability, context policy, tool harness, sampling configuration"},{"id":"p44s3","text":", and benchmark implementation."},{"id":"p45s1","text":"The portable unit is the protocol: workspace loading, selective routing, state externalization, veri"},{"id":"p45s2","text":"fication, and recovery. It is independent of a vendor-specific tokenizer or model API."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
